  "notes": "Modern white duplex: two flat-roofed 2-storey blocks with wide white fascia slabs edged by a thin orange clay-tile coping strip (schema gap: fascia has one colour - tile coping noted here, nearest sampled orange #e0a680), joined by a recessed link and a tall grey horizontal-slat chimney/stair tower that rises above the roofline. Ground floor of the left block is wrapped in grey horizontal slats left of a deep dark entry porch (white front door inside); upper-left facade has white horizontal siding; the right block carries a grey louvre panel over its porch. All small windows have grey awning-style iron bar grilles (schema gap: no bars field). Roof carries solar panels (dark #4d5969), solar tank and satellite dishes (prop factory pending). Frontage: tall white-brick compound wall with a full-height corrugated grey metal vehicle gate at left, orange-brick pillar accents (#c79e79) and a loose orange brick pile by the wall corner, grey block low walls and a raised concrete planter trough, grey paver sidewalk with a terracotta brick driveway apron (#e2a67c joint #b69c7d - schema gap: two paving materials per frontage), small lawn strips and flower clumps, grey utility/meter cabinets by the right pedestrian gate (prop factory pending). Road itself not visible in the ref (asphalt hex from shaded corner). Low hills with lollipop trees in the background. Sampled colours from 12x9 + 24x18 grids 2026-07-03."
